Waystar provides revenue cycle technology solutions for healthcare organizations, helping them streamline claims, payments, and patient financial engagement. The goal of this POC was to build an AI-powered assistant that improves support and self-service for Waystar's ATLAS Community platform.

Key business needs addressed:

Reduce the volume of manual support tickets

Help users find answers faster using existing knowledge content

Automate repetitive account, billing, and webinar-related tasks

Improve internal efficiency and client experience

The POC successfully demonstrated that Salesforce Agentforce can automate support for 75,000+ community users and 30,000 clients, offering guided help for knowledge, billing inquiries, webinars, and user management.

